<!--
  The launch backdrop.

  These are the three stops of the gradient the launch video opens on, taken
  from Remotion/src/compositions/AlexStore/AlexStore.tsx:

      radial-gradient(1200px 1600px at 50% 40%,
                      #f5f3ff 0%, #fdf2f8 45%, #ecfeff 100%)

  The Android window is shown for the first few hundred milliseconds of a cold
  start, before Flutter has drawn anything. Matching it to the video's first
  frame is what makes that window invisible: the shopper sees one continuous
  surface from the launcher tap to the end of the video, rather than a white
  flash (or, in dark mode, a black one) followed by the video.

  The Dart side paints the same three stops behind the video texture for the
  same reason â€” see SplashScreen._backdrop. Changing one means changing both.
-->
<resources>
    <color name="splash_top">#F5F3FF</color>
    <color name="splash_mid">#FDF2F8</color>
    <color name="splash_bottom">#ECFEFF</color>
</resources>
